      "filename": "Bulgaria Bulgaria-0776 - Roman Theatre of Philippopolis (7432750780).jpg",
      "title": "File:Bulgaria Bulgaria-0776 - Roman Theatre of Philippopolis (7432750780).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/03/Bulgaria_Bulgaria-0776_-_Roman_Theatre_of_Philippopolis_%287432750780%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
